OL,3,GNEWSAHenry Nowak's killer's appeal
OL,4,A'ludicrous', says family
OL,5,
OL,6,FHenry Nowak's family say it is
OL,7,F"ludicrous" their son's killer is being
OL,8,Fallowed to appeal against his sentence
OL,9,Fand it is a "disgrace" his mother, who
OL,10,Fhid the murder weapon, will be released
OL,11,Ffrom prison early.
OL,13,FVickrum Digwa, 23, was found guilty of
OL,14,Fthe 18-year-old student's murder and
OL,15,Fsentenced to life in prison, with a
OL,16,F21-year minimum term, earlier this
OL,17,Fyear.
OL,19,FHe is appealing against his sentence on
OL,20,FThursday, arguing that it is too
OL,21,Fsevere.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
